    "title": "Former President Joe Biden & Son Hunter Visit Set Of 'Reacher' In Philadelphia - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Former President Joe Biden and his son, Hunter Biden, recently met up with the cast of Reacher during a surprise visit to the Parc restaurant in Rittenhouse Square in Philadelphia. While filming season 4, lead actor Alan Ritchson recounted thinking the pair were actors arriving at set when multiple black SUVs arrived at the restaurant, and the pair stepped out. An eyewitness told CBS, “I thought it was the end of the scene — that they were wrapping for the day. And no, it was, you know, Joe Biden [deciding] he needed some breakfast at Parc Rittenhouse.” The Bidens ate breakfast and walked around Rittenhouse Square. Ritchson posted photos of himself with the pair on Instagram Tuesday and wrote, “So our Reacher set got in the way of these legends… Was a privilege and honor to meet the Biden family. They couldn’t have been more lovely. Kind, joyful, gracious and present. We chatted briefly about simple stuff, like string theory and quantum entanglement. Then Joe beat me at arm wrestling. All in a day’s work.” Biden’s appearance comes just one month after the former president announced his diagnosis with prostate cancer . Hunter recently dropped his court case against the man who released the contents of his laptop, claiming to be millions of dollars in debt . The Bidens spent an hour inside the restaurant chatting with the Reacher crew and taking photos with fans. There’s currently no release date for Reacher ‘s Season 4 on Prime Video, but production began earlier this month.",
